     1,
     "Using the syntax:<p>ggplot &lt;<a href=\"http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/ggplot.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/ggplot.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792386861811000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1MpRctq0MuXUq33heeaCm7\">http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/ggplot.html</a>&gt;(mtcars, aes &lt;<a href=\"http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/aes.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/aes.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792386861811000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2bkMvQXKuvqMyjY_xgMSU8\">http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/aes.html</a>&gt;(x=factor(cyl), fill=factor(vs))) + geom_bar &lt;<a href=\"http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/geom_bar.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/geom_bar.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792386861811000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1J7g7SGh5CWL0XugaJSCDf\">http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/geom_bar.html</a>&gt;(position=&quot;fill&quot;) <p>as is found in <p><a href=\"http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/position_fill.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/position_fill.html&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792386861811000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZxxNtp6zmER_KcGTI3GbN\">http://had.co.nz/ggplot2/position_fill.html</a><p>yields a graph where the Y axis is labelled &quot;count&quot;. However it is clearly a proportion. <p><br></p></p></p></p></p>"
